{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object approached: take, process properties, perform task and move to destination. Else, approach or search for object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    />",
